===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[daylight]]|'''[[daylights]]'''|'''[[daylighting]]'''|'''[[daylighted]]''' ''or'' '''[[daylit]]'''}}

# To expose to daylight
# {{context|architecture|lang=en}} To provide sources of natural illumination such as [[skylight]]s or windows.
# To allow light in, as by drawing [[drapes]].
# {{context|landscaping|civil engineering|lang=en}} To run a drainage pipe to an opening from which its contents can drain away naturally.
# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To gain exposure to the open.
#: ''The seam of coal '''daylighted''' at a cliff by the river.''

